{
  "name": "Trellis: Session Generate (paced, one at a time)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": { "httpMethod": "POST", "path": "trellis-session-generate", "responseMode": "onReceived", "options": {} },
      "name": "Session Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [200, 340]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "row",
        "operation": "getAll",
        "tableId": "trellis_music_tracks",
        "returnAll": true,
        "filters": {
          "conditions": [
            { "keyName": "session_id", "condition": "eq", "keyValue": "={{ $json.body.session_id }}" },
            { "keyName": "status", "condition": "neq", "keyValue": "completed" }
          ]
        }
      },
      "name": "Get Tracks",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.supabase",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [400, 340],
      "credentials": { "supabaseApi": { "id": "REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_CREDENTIAL", "name": "Supabase account" } }
    },
    {
      "parameters": { "batchSize": 1, "options": {} },
      "name": "Loop Over Items",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitInBatches",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [620, 340]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "row",
        "operation": "update",
        "tableId": "trellis_music_tracks",
        "filters": { "conditions": [ { "keyName": "id", "condition": "eq", "keyValue": "={{ $('Loop Over Items').item.json.id }}" } ] },
        "dataToSend": "defineBelow",
        "fieldsUi": { "fieldValues": [ { "fieldId": "status", "fieldValue": "generating" }, { "fieldId": "updated_at", "fieldValue": "={{ $now.toISO() }}" } ] }
      },
      "name": "Mark Generating",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.supabase",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [840, 440],
      "credentials": { "supabaseApi": { "id": "REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_CREDENTIAL", "name": "Supabase account" } }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com/v1beta/interactions",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": { "parameters": [ { "name": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" } ] },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ model: ($('Loop Over Items').item.json.duration_seconds <= 45 ? 'lyria-3-clip-preview' : 'lyria-3-pro-preview'), input: $('Loop Over Items').item.json.prompt, response_format: { type: 'audio' } }) }}"
      },
      "name": "Lyria Generate",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4,
      "position": [1060, 440]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForEachItem",
        "jsCode": "const r = $json;\nlet b64 = r.output_audio?.data;\nif (!b64 && Array.isArray(r.steps)) {\n  for (const step of r.steps) {\n    const content = step.model_output?.content || step.content || [];\n    const audio = (Array.isArray(content) ? content : []).find(c => c.type === 'audio' && c.data);\n    if (audio) { b64 = audio.data; break; }\n  }\n}\nif (!b64) throw new Error('No audio found. Keys: ' + Object.keys(r).join(', '));\nreturn { json: { hasAudio: true }, binary: { data: await this.helpers.prepareBinaryData(Buffer.from(b64, 'base64'), 'track.mp3', 'audio/mpeg') } };"
      },
      "name": "Audio base64 to Binary",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [1280, 440]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ 'https://horvjqqifgrzxesuxtfm.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/music-sessions/' + $('Loop Over Items').item.json.session_id + '/tracks/' + $('Loop Over Items').item.json.id + '.mp3' }}",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": { "parameters": [ { "name": "Content-Type", "value": "audio/mpeg" }, { "name": "x-upsert", "value": "true" } ] },
        "sendBody": true,
        "contentType": "binaryData",
        "inputDataFieldName": "data"
      },
      "name": "Upload Track",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4,
      "position": [1500, 440]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "row",
        "operation": "update",
        "tableId": "trellis_music_tracks",
        "filters": { "conditions": [ { "keyName": "id", "condition": "eq", "keyValue": "={{ $('Loop Over Items').item.json.id }}" } ] },
        "dataToSend": "defineBelow",
        "fieldsUi": { "fieldValues": [
          { "fieldId": "status", "fieldValue": "completed" },
          { "fieldId": "storage_bucket", "fieldValue": "music-sessions" },
          { "fieldId": "storage_path", "fieldValue": "={{ $('Loop Over Items').item.json.session_id + '/tracks/' + $('Loop Over Items').item.json.id + '.mp3' }}" },
          { "fieldId": "audio_url", "fieldValue": "={{ 'https://horvjqqifgrzxesuxtfm.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/music-sessions/' + $('Loop Over Items').item.json.session_id + '/tracks/' + $('Loop Over Items').item.json.id + '.mp3' }}" },
          { "fieldId": "audio_mime_type", "fieldValue": "audio/mpeg" },
          { "fieldId": "updated_at", "fieldValue": "={{ $now.toISO() }}" }
        ] }
      },
      "name": "Mark Completed",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.supabase",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1720, 440],
      "credentials": { "supabaseApi": { "id": "REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_CREDENTIAL", "name": "Supabase account" } }
    },
    {
      "parameters": { "amount": 8, "unit": "seconds" },
      "name": "Wait",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.wait",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [1940, 440]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "row",
        "operation": "update",
        "tableId": "trellis_music_sessions",
        "filters": { "conditions": [ { "keyName": "id", "condition": "eq", "keyValue": "={{ $('Session Webhook').item.json.body.session_id }}" } ] },
        "dataToSend": "defineBelow",
        "fieldsUi": { "fieldValues": [ { "fieldId": "status", "fieldValue": "review" }, { "fieldId": "updated_at", "fieldValue": "={{ $now.toISO() }}" } ] }
      },
      "name": "Mark Session Review",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.supabase",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [840, 200],
      "credentials": { "supabaseApi": { "id": "REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_CREDENTIAL", "name": "Supabase account" } }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Trellis: Session Generate (paced)\n\nGenerates a whole session's tracks **one at a time** so we never flood Lyria's preview quota. Fired ONCE by `sessionService.generateSessionTracks`.\n\n**Webhook:** `https://n8n.sproutify.app/webhook/trellis-session-generate`\n**POST body:** `{ session_id, branch }`\n\n### FLOW\nWebhook → **Get Tracks** (non-completed rows for the session) → **Loop Over Items (batch 1)** → Mark Generating → Lyria → base64→Binary → Upload → Mark Completed → **Wait 8s** → back to Loop → (when done) **Mark Session Review**.\n\n### SETUP\n1. Set **Credential → your Supabase account** on all 4 Supabase nodes (Get Tracks, Mark Generating, Mark Completed, Mark Session Review).\n2. **Lyria** + **Upload** are HTTP: set Lyria's *Authentication → Predefined Credential Type → your Gemini credential*; set Upload's *Authentication → Predefined Credential Type → your Supabase credential*.\n3. **⚠️ Verify the loop wiring after import** (n8n loop connections are fragile): **Loop Over Items** has two outputs — **done** (top) → *Mark Session Review*, and **loop** (bottom) → *Mark Generating*. And **Wait → back into Loop Over Items**. Re-draw those 3 links if the import didn't keep them.\n4. Tune the **Wait** (8s) up if you still see 429s.\n\n**Naming:** tracks now store as `music-sessions/{session_id}/tracks/{track_id}.mp3` — globally unique (no more `track-1.mp3` collisions).\n\nSingle-track **regenerate** still uses the separate `trellis-session-track-generate` workflow (E2).",
        "width": 620,
        "height": 640
      },
      "name": "Setup Notes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [100, -360]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Session Webhook": { "main": [[{ "node": "Get Tracks", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]] },
    "Get Tracks": { "main": [[{ "node": "Loop Over Items", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]] },
    "Loop Over Items": { "main": [ [{ "node": "Mark Session Review", "type": "main", "index": 0 }], [{ "node": "Mark Generating", "type": "main", "index": 0 }] ] },
    "Mark Generating": { "main": [[{ "node": "Lyria Generate", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]] },
    "Lyria Generate": { "main": [[{ "node": "Audio base64 to Binary", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]] },
    "Audio base64 to Binary": { "main": [[{ "node": "Upload Track", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]] },
    "Upload Track": { "main": [[{ "node": "Mark Completed", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]] },
    "Mark Completed": { "main": [[{ "node": "Wait", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]] },
    "Wait": { "main": [[{ "node": "Loop Over Items", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]] }
  }
}
